flowchart TB
    classDef owner fill:#f7ead7,stroke:#8a5a20,color:#3e280d
    classDef singleton fill:#e8f1f2,stroke:#2f5d62,color:#163438
    classDef adapter fill:#fff3d6,stroke:#9a6b14,color:#513807
    classDef engine fill:#e9f3df,stroke:#557a35,color:#2e431d
    classDef resource fill:#f3e6ec,stroke:#8b4865,color:#4b2637

    ROOT[providePetDesktopRuntime<br/>App Composition Root]:::owner

    STORE[TurnPlaybackSessionStore<br/>单例：turn/segment facts]:::singleton
    ADAPTER[AdapterConnection<br/>单例：WebSocket 与 inbound]:::adapter
    TL[PlaybackTimelineRuntime<br/>单例：segment timeline registry]:::singleton
    ENGINE[ModelEngine<br/>单例：动作编译与 pending scheduler]:::engine
    PLAYER[PreviewMotionPlayer<br/>单例：当前 motion run owner]:::engine
    RECORDER[MotionPlaybackRecorder<br/>单例：动作观察记录]:::engine
    COMPLETE[PlaybackCompletionCoordinator<br/>单例：playback ACK]:::singleton

    ROOT -->|创建并持有| STORE
    ROOT -->|创建并持有| ADAPTER
    ROOT -->|直接创建并持有| TL
    ROOT -->|创建并持有| ENGINE
    ROOT -->|创建并持有| PLAYER
    ROOT -->|创建并持有| RECORDER
    ROOT -->|创建并持有| COMPLETE

    subgraph ADAPTER_OWNED[Adapter 内部协议与播放 ports]
        TRANSPORT[WebSocket transport]:::adapter
        INBOUND[InboundRuntime]:::adapter
        AUDIOSTATE[Adapter audio UI state]:::adapter
        ATC[AudioTimelineController]:::adapter
        LIPRUNTIME[LipSyncRuntime<br/>每个音频 segment]:::resource
    end

    BROWSERAUDIO[BrowserAudioTimelineSink<br/>由 App 创建，播放时持有 AudioElement]:::resource

    ADAPTER --> TRANSPORT
    ADAPTER --> INBOUND
    ADAPTER --> AUDIOSTATE
    ADAPTER --> ATC
    ROOT -->|创建并附加| BROWSERAUDIO
    ADAPTER -->|提供 text/audio sinks 与 UI ports| TL
    TL -->|启动 segment audio sink| ATC
    ATC --> BROWSERAUDIO
    ATC --> LIPRUNTIME

    subgraph TIMELINES[Timeline 按段持有]
        ENTRY[PlaybackTimelineEntry<br/>key = turn_id + message_id]:::singleton
        TENGINE[PlaybackTimelineEngine<br/>每个 segment 一个]:::singleton
        ACLOCK[segment-bound AudioClock<br/>或 explicit synthetic clock]:::resource
        SINKS[registered sinks<br/>audio / motion / lip_sync]:::resource
        PROJ[SessionProjection<br/>单例：Store lifecycle port]:::singleton
        ENTRY --> TENGINE
        TENGINE --> ACLOCK
        TENGINE --> SINKS
        TL --> ENTRY
        TL --> PROJ
    end

    INBOUND -->|commit protocol facts| STORE
    PROJ -->|project execution facts| STORE
    STORE -.完整 segment 唯一素材源.-> TL
    TL -->|motion sink start| ENGINE
    ENGINE -->|parameter plan| PLAYER
    PLAYER -->|Live2D adapter| MODEL[当前 Live2D Model Instance]:::resource
    PLAYER -.run started/terminal.-> TL
    BROWSERAUDIO -.duration/playing/terminal.-> TL
    BROWSERAUDIO -.playing event 携带本 AudioElement clock.-> ACLOCK
    LIPRUNTIME -.started/terminal.-> TL
    COMPLETE -->|读取 settled facts| STORE
    COMPLETE -->|control.playback_finished| ADAPTER
    RECORDER -.观察 player/timeline.-> TL

    subgraph LIFETIME[销毁规则]
        D1[App scope dispose<br/>断开 transport / 清理 watchers]:::owner
        D2[用户显式中断 Turn<br/>停止对应 segment timelines]:::owner
        D3[Audio terminal<br/>释放 AudioElement 与 WebAudio graph]:::owner
        D4[Model replacement<br/>取消旧 load generation 后 dispose]:::owner
    end

    D1 -.销毁.-> ADAPTER
    D1 -.销毁.-> TL
    D2 -.按身份停止.-> ENTRY
    D3 -.释放.-> BROWSERAUDIO
    D3 -.释放.-> LIPRUNTIME
    D4 -.替换.-> MODEL

    RULE[实例规则<br/>App 是 Timeline 与 BrowserAudioSink 的创建所有者<br/>不得创建第二个 Timeline Runtime<br/>不得查询全局 active audio clock<br/>所有中断必须携带 turn_id + message_id]:::owner
